; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/202609160415281766.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/202609160415281766.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷公布新一期友谊赛名单，梅西回归参加告别赛，劳塔罗、阿尔瓦雷斯入选。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-16/6aa9a896e8514native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">最后的战役！官方：梅西将参加10月6日阿根廷对阵贝宁的友谊赛</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-16/6aa96cb632cbbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">皇萨抢人！邮报独家：皇马追求曼联15岁天才JJ，希望击败巴萨签约</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/202609160012543225.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/202609160012543225.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/202609160012543225.jpg"> </div><p>英国《每日邮报》独家消息，皇马已经对JJ·加布里埃尔展开了追求。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-16/6aa973bbee9a9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">全欧眼馋！罗马诺：JJ三天前通知曼联离队，皇萨巴黎拜仁都在关注</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-15/6aa966c7ac491native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">下一站皇马？15岁曼联天才JJ申请离队，已关注皇马全队+二队账号</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-16/6aa96c7c63a9fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">承认误判！韦伯：曼市德比VAR未识别恩佐越位犯规，已向曼联致歉</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/202609160006525685_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/202609160006525685_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/202609160006525685_720.jpg"> </div><p>英超裁判主管霍华德·韦伯承认，视频助理裁判（VAR）未能评估周日曼彻斯特德比中，哈兰德打进制胜球时恩佐的越位犯规。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-16/6aa970365b3b9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">混乱！福登染红时VAR正检查恩佐禁区内是否犯规，与助理各说各的</a></p><p>英超赛季首期Match Officials Mic'd Up（裁判复盘）节目公布了福登被罚下时的VAR裁判对话。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-16/6aa96f448bb0anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">韦伯：B费先踢福登更多属于任性而非暴力，应是黄牌但VAR无法介入</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-16/6aa96a6307f5bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">谁拿金球？西蒙尼：梅西，以他的年龄和世界杯表现毫无疑问是梅西</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.88" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260915/202609152357101861.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.88" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.88" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260915/202609152357101861_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260915/202609152357101861_720.jpg"> </div><p>马竞主帅西蒙尼被问及自己对今年金球奖得主的看法，而他明确表示支持梅西获奖。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-16/6aa97de23cb8enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">后梅西时代！阿根廷官宣友谊赛对手：玻利维亚、布基纳法索、贝宁</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.33" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/202609160118468987.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.33" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.33" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/202609160118468987_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/202609160118468987_720.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷足协宣布，阿根廷在三场友谊赛中将面对的对手分别是为玻利维亚、布基纳法索和贝宁。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-16/6aa97fd97c735native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">ESPN：阿根廷新一期名单仍将征召梅西！希望让他在本土踢场告别赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.33" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/6a5f572033db0_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.33" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.33" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/6a5f572033db0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/6a5f572033db0.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷ESPN记者Fede Bueno在节目中表示，阿根廷仍将征召梅西，让他在阿根廷本土踢一场告别赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-16/6aa9813bdcd33native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">14年世界杯一球成名！官方：35岁J罗从哥伦比亚国家队退役</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/202609160140223825.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/202609160140223825_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260916/202609160140223825_720.jpg"> </div><p>J罗通过社媒宣布，将从哥伦比亚国家队退役。</p><script> 	$(function(){ 	    $(".video-bg").find('span').click(function(){/*视频播放*/             var _this = this;             var index = $(".video-bg span").index(this);             var MediaArr = document.getElementsByTagName("video");             $(this).parent().hide();             MediaArr[index].play();             MediaArr[index].controls = true;             $(".video-box").each(function(i, item) {                 if ($(this).find('span').get(0) !== _this) {                     $(this).find('.video-bg').show();                     MediaArr[i].pause();                     MediaArr[i].controls = false;                 }             })         });  	if(typeof(ca